flowchart TB
  ISP[Central ISP Staff] --> WEB[KikiNet Web App]
  PARTNER[Partner Staff] --> WEB
  CUSTOMER[Customer / Public Viewer] --> PUBLIC[Public Invoice Page]
  WEB --> APP[Laravel Modular Monolith]
  PUBLIC --> APP
  APP --> BIZ[(PostgreSQL Business DB)]
  APP --> REDIS[(Redis Queue / Cache)]
  REDIS --> WORKER[Laravel Workers]
  WORKER --> RADIUSDB[(PostgreSQL RADIUS DB)]
  NAS[MikroTik PPPoE NAS Fleet] <--> FR[FreeRADIUS Primary / Secondary]
  FR <--> RADIUSDB
  WORKER <--> NAS
  APP <--> PAYMENT[Payment Provider]
  APP <--> WA[WhatsApp Provider]
  APP --> AI[Read-only AI Provider]
